于目标的最大生命值造成伤害，并且造成伤害的一定百分比会治疗凯。", "description_en": "Kez enters into an uncontrollable state for %AbilityCastPoint% second, becoming invulnerable for %invuln_period%s and receiving a basic dispel.If the cast completes successfully, Kez performs a series of deadly radial slashes around him that deal damage based on the max health of the target and heal Kez for a percentage of all damage dealt.", "notes_zh": ["斩击非英雄单位或幻象时吸血量减少至%illusion_lifesteal_pct%%%。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["strike_interval", "strikes", "radius", "base_damage", "max_health_damage_pct", "lifesteal_pct", "illusion_lifesteal_pct", "invuln_period", "basic_dispel", "AbilityCastPoint", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"], "judge": [{"mechanism": "aoe_damage", "condition": "base"}, {"mechanism": "applies_basic_dispel", "condition": "base"}, {"mechanism": "healing", "condition": "base"}, {"mechanism": "invulnerable_untargetable", "condition": "base"}, {"mechanism": "lifesteal", "condition": "base"}]}, {"subject": "kez_falcon_rush", "name_zh": "凯·天隼冲击", "name_en": "Falcon Rush", "description_zh": "开启后凯可以向敌方目标冲去，发动的攻击会重复一次。在这个状态下，凯拥有相位移动状态和减速抗性。", "description_en": "Kez gains the ability to rush towards enemy targets to deliver echoing secondary attacks.  While in this state, Kez has phased collision and slow resistance.", "notes_zh": ["不会对建筑生效。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["rush_range", "rush_speed", "base_echo_damage", "slow_resist", "duration", "break_range", "bonus_attack_speed", "echo_proc_chance_reduction", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"], "judge": [{"mechanism": "phased", "condition": "base"}, {"mechanism": "slow_resistance", "condition": "base"}]}, {"subject": "kez_talon_toss", "name_zh": "凯·利爪飞掷", "name_en": "Talon Toss", "description_zh": "凯向目标单位掷出一把钗，施加一次固定伤害的攻击，并造成沉默。", "description_en": "Kez throws a Sai at the target unit, applying a fixed damage attack and silence.", "notes_zh": ["固定伤害的攻击具有克